==Latin==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Indo-European|gʷerH-|to welcome, greet, praise|lang=la}}. Cognates include Sanskrit {{term|sc=Deva|गृणाति|tr=gṛṇā́ti||to praise|lang=sa}}, Old Church Slavonic {{term|sc=Cyrs|жрьти|tr=žrĭti||to sacrifice|lang=cu}} and Old Prussian {{term|girtwei||to praise|lang=prg}}.

===Adjective===
{{la-adj-1&2|grātus|grata|grāta|gratum|grātum}}

# [[pleasing]], [[acceptable]], [[agreeable]], [[welcome]]
# [[dear]], [[beloved]]
# [[grateful]], [[thankful]]

